<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Boy in Love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Rocco</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Boy In Love</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3yLW6yiEZT1ToDl4eLHuxv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.057" end="00:17.899">I’m just a boy in love, mhm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.899" end="00:21.673">I don’t think I’m getting up from this one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.673" end="00:26.675">I’m just a boy in love, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.675" end="00:28.175">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.551" end="00:29.051">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.422" end="00:29.922">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.619" end="00:31.119">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.953" end="00:31.453" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.151" end="00:33.620">I’m just a boy in love, mhm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.620" end="00:37.234">I don’t think I’m getting up from this one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.234" end="00:42.083">I’m just a boy in love, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.083" end="00:43.583">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.069" end="00:44.569">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.985" end="00:45.485">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.051" end="00:46.551">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.356" end="00:46.856" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.598" end="00:48.049">When she walked in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.049" end="00:50.541">All the boys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.541" end="00:53.343">Turned their heads and stared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.343" end="00:55.936">I’m not gonna lie, I did the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.936" end="00:57.801">But who can you blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.801" end="01:00.170">When it’s her (when it’s her)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.170" end="01:01.670" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.208" end="01:03.504">I put out my chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.504" end="01:06.089">And I said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.089" end="01:09.105">One day, she will be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.105" end="01:10.775">But what do I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.775" end="01:13.310">Do I ask for her name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.310" end="01:15.299">But for now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.299" end="01:16.799">But for now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.760" end="01:17.260" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.244" end="01:20.423">I’m just a boy in love, mhm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.423" end="01:24.114">I don’t think I’m getting up from this one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.114" end="01:28.917">I’m just a boy in love, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.917" end="01:30.417">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.878" end="01:31.378">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.827" end="01:32.327">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.845" end="01:33.345">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.368" end="01:33.868" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.682" end="01:37.349">How did I land you, girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.349" end="01:40.212">I’m in disbelief</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.212" end="01:42.017">A guy like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.017" end="01:44.039">A girl like her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.039" end="01:48.873">It’s like we’re in a teenage movie scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.873" end="01:50.373" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.101" end="01:51.051">Girl, you took my heart away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.051" end="01:53.044">But it’s not that hard to take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.044" end="01:54.953">Hope you don’t throw it away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.953" end="01:56.926">And leave my heart in constant ache</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.926" end="02:00.395">But I might just forgive ya, darling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.395" end="02:02.474">Cause I, Cause I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.474" end="02:03.974" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.091" end="02:07.026">I’m just a boy in love, mhm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.026" end="02:10.823">I don’t think I’m getting up from this one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.823" end="02:15.758">I’m just a boy in love, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.758" end="02:17.258">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.658" end="02:18.158">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.605" end="02:19.105">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.633" end="02:20.133">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.946" end="02:20.446" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.126" end="02:22.908">I’m just a boy in love, mhm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.908" end="02:26.412">I don’t think I’m getting up from this one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.412" end="02:31.280">I’m just a boy in love, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.280" end="02:32.780">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.349" end="02:33.849">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.400" end="02:34.900">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.315" end="02:35.815">And, I'm stuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.270" end="02:37.206">On you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.206" end="02:38.706" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.188" end="02:42.717">I’m just a boy in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.717" end="02:45.218">A boy in la, la, la, love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.218" end="02:48.121">Shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.121" end="02:52.121">This happens everytime</p></div></body></tt>